{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56225","headline":"寄禅月大师 · 韦庄","name":"寄禅月大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新春新霁好晴和，间濶吾师鄙恡多。\n不是爲穷常见隔，只应嫌醉不相过。\n云离谷口俱无着，日到天心各几何。\n万事不如碁一局，雨堂闲夜许来麽？\n（《禅月集》卷十九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}